===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|æsc||[[ash]] tree}} + {{m|ang|leah||[[wood]], [[clearing]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈæʃli/|lang=en}}

